Best Daily Sync Workflow (Recommended)
Run these commands every time you work:


# 1. Go to your project folder
cd C:\Veridion Pro

# 2. Switch to main branch (if you're not already on it)
git checkout main

# 3. Pull latest changes from GitHub (IMPORTANT - do this first!)
git pull origin main

# 4. Make your changes (edit code, add files, etc.)

# 5. When you're ready to save:
git add .                    # or git add specific-file.py
git commit -m "Short description of what you changed"

# 6. Push to GitHub
git push origin main